  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "SceneFog is a core data model class responsible for encapsulating all parameters related to atmospheric fog simulation within a 3D rendering scene. It manages configuration details such as fog type (LINEAR, EXPONENTIAL), starting distance, density, and color. As a JsonSerializable, its primary architectural role is to provide a structured, serializable representation of fog effects, allowing for easy persistence to and loading from JSON structures."
